  "title": "Trona Road becomes Highway 178",
  "text": "About 7.8 miles of Trona Road became part of the state highway system in 1947, with the addition of Legislative Route 212. That portion runs from Poison Canyon westward and is now part of State Route 178. Pinnacle Road, which meets the highway here, is the entrance to the Trona Pinnacles, five miles away.",
