      "quote": "Trona Road from Poison Canyon westward approximately 7.8 miles is carried as part of California State Route 178. ... An approximately 7.8-mile portion of Trona Road would become part of the State Highway System in 1947 following the addition of Legislative Route Number 212. ... Pinnacle Road serves as the entrance to the Trona Pinnacles located five miles to the south."
